      "spam": false,
      "value": "The problem is that motion controls are at its best with a sensor bar. Although the Joycons can imitate movement and 3D space. I do not believe it can detect where tbey are all the time. Notice how oculus, vive, and even the windows co trollers have at least 2 cameras. Where as the joyco s only have one on one controller. And doesnt see like most sensor bars. The tracking would be terrible.\n\nAlthough the concept is brilliant, and I would love to use the HD rumble, it probably wont work well, if at all.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
